abstract: "Real Antarctic ice shelf mass budget (71 of 162 shelves lost mass 1997-2021, 8.3 trillion tonnes total, Davison et al. 2023), a real Holocene meltwater-release feedback mechanism (Nature Geoscience 2025), and a real sign-flipped regional asymmetry under CMIP6 projections -- East Antarctica's feedback amplifies warming, West Antarctica's Amundsen/Bellingshausen sectors show cooling/suppressed warming (Muilwijk et al. 2026, The Cryosphere). Deliberately no UTAC/CREP/AFET bridge and no invented Gamma value -- see DISCLAIMER.md. GenesisAeon P120."
